    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#TransitiveProperty"/>
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/coarserThan"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Collega un'unità formale a un'unità formale di granularità testuale più ampia (es. la lettera rispetto a sillaba e parola), esclusivamente entro il FormalUnitScheme. La proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a formal unit to a formal unit of coarser textual granularity (e.g., a letter with respect to a syllable or a word), exclusively within the FormalUnitScheme. The property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">ha granularità più fine di</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has finer granularity than</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/coarserThan -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/coarserThan">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#TransitiveProperty"/>
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/finerThan"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Collega un'unità formale a un'unità formale di granularità testuale più fine (es. la parola rispetto a sillaba e lettera), esclusivamente entro il FormalUnitScheme. La proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a formal unit to a formal unit of finer textual granularity (e.g., a word with respect to a syllable or a letter), exclusively within the FormalUnitScheme. The property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">ha granularità più ampia di</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has coarser granularity than</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>

    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2_has_type -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2_has_type">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2i_is_type_of"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E55_Type"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">P2 has type</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">P2 ha tipo</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS classifica un'espressione secondo la sua forma letteraria o artistica (es. prosa, poesia, poesia visiva). La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E1_CRM_Entity e come range crm:E55_Type. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range crm:E55_Type.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it classifies an expression by its literary or artistic form (e.g., prose, poetry, visual poetry). The original property has domain crm:E1_CRM_Entity and range crm:E55_Type. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range crm:E55_Type.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>

    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2i_is_type_of -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2i_is_type_of">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E55_Type"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">P2i is type of</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">P2i è tipo di</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di P2 has type: in DeSMòS collega un tipo di forma letteraria o artistica alle espressioni che classifica. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E55_Type e come range crm:E1_CRM_Entity. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain crm:E55_Type e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of P2 has type: in DeSMòS, it relates a literary or artistic form type to the expressions it classifies. The original property has domain crm:E55_Type and range crm:E1_CRM_Entity. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain crm:E55_Type and range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15_has_fragment -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15_has_fragment">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15i_is_fragment_of"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E90_Symbolic_Object"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS collega un'espressione alla dichiarazione peritestuale contenuta nella stessa pubblicazione, che ne è un frammento e documenta l'impiego di una costrizione. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range crm:E90_Symbolic_Object. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it relates an expression to the peritextual declaration contained in the same publication, which is a fragment of it and documents the use of a constraint. The original property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range crm:E90_Symbolic_Object. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R15 ha frammento</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R15 has fragment</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15i_is_fragment_of -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15i_is_fragment_of">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E90_Symbolic_Object"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di R15 has fragment: in DeSMòS collega una dichiarazione peritestuale all'espressione di cui è frammento. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E90_Symbolic_Object e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of R15 has fragment: in DeSMòS, it relates a peritextual declaration to the expression of which it is a fragment. The original property has domain crm:E90_Symbolic_Object and range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object and range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R15i is fragment of</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R15i è frammento di</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>

    <!-- http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17_created -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17_created">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17i_was_created_by"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS collega un evento di creazione dell'espressione all'espressione testuale che produce. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it relates an expression creation event to the textual expression it produces. The original property has domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R17 created</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R17 ha creato</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17i_was_created_by -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17i_was_created_by">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di R17 created: in DeSMòS collega un'espressione testuale all'evento compositivo che l'ha prodotta. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of R17 created: in DeSMòS, it relates a textual expression to the compositional event that produced it. The original property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R17i was created by</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R17i è stata creata da</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>

    <!-- http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R3_is_realised_in -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R3_is_realised_in">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R3i_realises"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F1_Work"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS collega un'opera all'espressione testuale che la realizza. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F1_Work e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F1_Work e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it relates a work to the textual expression that realises it. The original property has domain lrmoo:F1_Work and range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F1_Work and range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R3 is realised in</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R3 è realizzato in</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>

    <!-- http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R3i_realises -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R3i_realises">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F1_Work"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di R3 is realised in: in DeSMòS collega un'espressione testuale all'opera che realizza. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F1_Work. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F1_Work.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of R3 is realised in: in DeSMòS, it relates a textual expression to the work it realises. The original property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F1_Work. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F1_Work.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R3i realises</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R3i realizza</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4_embodies -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4_embodies">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4i_is_embodied_in"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F3_Manifestation"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS collega una manifestazione editoriale o digitale all'espressione che incorpora. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F3_Manifestation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F3_Manifestation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it relates a published or digital manifestation to the expression it embodies. The original property has domain lrmoo:F3_Manifestation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F3_Manifestation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R4 embodies</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R4 incarna</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4i_is_embodied_in -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4i_is_embodied_in">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F3_Manifestation"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di R4 embodies: in DeSMòS collega un'espressione alla manifestazione editoriale o digitale che la incorpora. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F3_Manifestation. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F3_Manifestation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of R4 embodies: in DeSMòS, it relates an expression to the published or digital manifestation embodying it. The original property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F3_Manifestation. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F3_Manifestation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R4i is embodied in</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R4i è incarnata in</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76_is_derivative_of -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76_is_derivative_of">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130_shows_features_of"/>
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76i_has_derivative"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS indica che un'espressione deriva da un'altra espressione assunta come fonte nella sua creazione. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it states that an expression derives from another expression used as a source in its creation. The original property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R76 è derivato di</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R76 is derivative of</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76i_has_derivative -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76i_has_derivative">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di R76 is derivative of: in DeSMòS collega un'espressione fonte alle espressioni che ne derivano. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of R76 is derivative of: in DeSMòS, it relates a source expression to the expressions derived from it. The original property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R76i ha derivato</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R76i has derivative</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P129_is_about -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P129_is_about">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P129i_is_subject_of"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS indica che una dichiarazione (oggetto linguistico) ha come argomento una costrizione letteraria. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object e come range crm:E1_CRM_Entity. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object e come range desmos:LiteraryConstraint.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it states that a declaration (linguistic object) has a literary constraint as its subject. The original property has domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object and range crm:E1_CRM_Entity. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object and range desmos:LiteraryConstraint.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">P129 is about</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">P129 verte su</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P129i_is_subject_of -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P129i_is_subject_of">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di P129 is about: in DeSMòS collega una costrizione letteraria alle dichiarazioni che la hanno come argomento. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E1_CRM_Entity e come range crm:E89_Propositional_Object. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint e come range crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of P129 is about: in DeSMòS, it relates a literary constraint to the declarations that have it as their subject. The original property has domain crm:E1_CRM_Entity and range crm:E89_Propositional_Object. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint and range crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">P129i is subject of</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">P129i è oggetto di</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130_shows_features_of -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130_shows_features_of">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130i_features_are_also_found_on"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E70_Thing"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E70_Thing"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS documenta un legame tra espressioni più blando di R76 is derivative of: l'espressione presenta tratti di una fonte (lessicali, onomastici, fraseologici, tematici, narrativi o, per fonti non testuali, di andamento) senza derivarne il contenuto né instaurare una relazione intertestuale INTRO. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E70_Thing e come range crm:E70_Thing. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it documents a looser link between expressions than R76 is derivative of: the expression shows features of a source (lexical, onomastic, phraseological, thematic, narrative or, for non-textual sources, of tempo and pacing) without deriving its content or establishing an INTRO intertextual relation. The original property has domain crm:E70_Thing and range crm:E70_Thing. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">P130 presenta caratteristiche di</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">P130 shows features of</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>

    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130i_features_are_also_found_on -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130i_features_are_also_found_on">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E70_Thing"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E70_Thing"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di P130 shows features of: in DeSMòS collega un'espressione assunta come fonte alle espressioni che ne presentano tratti senza derivarne il contenuto. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E70_Thing e come range crm:E70_Thing. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of P130 shows features of: in DeSMòS, it relates an expression used as a source to the expressions showing its features without deriving its content. The original property has domain crm:E70_Thing and range crm:E70_Thing. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">P130i caratteristiche si ritrovano anche in</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">P130i features are also found on</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>

    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148_has_component -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148_has_component">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#TransitiveProperty"/>
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148i_is_component_of"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS articola espressioni e manifestazioni complesse nelle rispettive componenti. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object e come range crm:E89_Propositional_Object. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression (tra espressioni) o lrmoo:F3_Manifestation (tra manifestazioni) e come range rispettivamente lrmoo:F2_Expression o lrmoo:F3_Manifestation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it decomposes complex expressions and manifestations into their components. The original property has domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object and range crm:E89_Propositional_Object. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression (between expressions) or lrmoo:F3_Manifestation (between manifestations) and range lrmoo:F2_Expression or lrmoo:F3_Manifestation respectively.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">P148 ha componente</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">P148 has component</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148i_is_component_of -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P148i_is_component_of">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#TransitiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di P148 has component: in DeSMòS collega una componente all'espressione o manifestazione complessa di cui fa parte. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object e come range crm:E89_Propositional_Object. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression (tra espressioni) o lrmoo:F3_Manifestation (tra manifestazioni) e come range rispettivamente lrmoo:F2_Expression o lrmoo:F3_Manifestation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of P148 has component: in DeSMòS, it relates a component to the complex expression or manifestation it belongs to. The original property has domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object and range crm:E89_Propositional_Object. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression (between expressions) or lrmoo:F3_Manifestation (between manifestations) and range lrmoo:F2_Expression or lrmoo:F3_Manifestation respectively.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">P148i is component of</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">P148i è componente di</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P14_carried_out_by -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P14_carried_out_by">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P14i_performed"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E39_Actor"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS collega un evento di creazione dell'espressione al suo autore o ai suoi autori. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E7_Activity e come range crm:E39_Actor. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation e come range crm:E39_Actor.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it relates an expression creation event to its author or authors. The original property has domain crm:E7_Activity and range crm:E39_Actor. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation and range crm:E39_Actor.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">P14 carried out by</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">P14 eseguito da</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P14i_performed -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P14i_performed">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E39_Actor"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di P14 carried out by: in DeSMòS collega un autore agli eventi di creazione dell'espressione che ha realizzato. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E39_Actor e come range crm:E7_Activity. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain crm:E39_Actor e come range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of P14 carried out by: in DeSMòS, it relates an author to the expression creation events they carried out. The original property has domain crm:E39_Actor and range crm:E7_Activity. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain crm:E39_Actor and range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">P14i ha eseguito</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">P14i performed</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E29_Design_or_Procedure"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS collega un evento di creazione dell'espressione alla costrizione letteraria impiegata come procedura compositiva. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E7_Activity e come range crm:E29_Design_or_Procedure. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation e come range desmos:LiteraryConstraint.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it relates an expression creation event to the literary constraint employed as a compositional procedure. The original property has domain crm:E7_Activity and range crm:E29_Design_or_Procedure. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation and range desmos:LiteraryConstraint.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">P33 ha usato la tecnica specifica</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">P33 used specific technique</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E29_Design_or_Procedure"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di P33 used specific technique: in DeSMòS collega una costrizione letteraria agli eventi di creazione dell'espressione in cui è stata impiegata. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E29_Design_or_Procedure e come range crm:E7_Activity. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint e come range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of P33 used specific technique: in DeSMòS, it relates a literary constraint to the expression creation events in which it was employed. The original property has domain crm:E29_Design_or_Procedure and range crm:E7_Activity. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint and range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">P33i was used by</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">P33i è stata usata da</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P67_refers_to -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P67_refers_to">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P67i_is_referred_to_by"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS collega una dichiarazione (oggetto linguistico) all'espressione testuale a cui fa riferimento. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object e come range crm:E1_CRM_Entity. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it relates a declaration (linguistic object) to the textual expression it refers to. The original property has domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object and range crm:E1_CRM_Entity. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object and range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">P67 refers to</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">P67 si riferisce a</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P67i_is_referred_to_by -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P67i_is_referred_to_by">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di P67 refers to: in DeSMòS collega un'espressione testuale alle dichiarazioni che vi fanno riferimento. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E1_CRM_Entity e come range crm:E89_Propositional_Object. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of P67 refers to: in DeSMòS, it relates a textual expression to the declarations referring to it. The original property has domain crm:E1_CRM_Entity and range crm:E89_Propositional_Object. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range crm:E33_Linguistic_Object.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">P67i is referred to by</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">P67i è riferito da</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS collega un concetto a un concetto più generale entro gli schemi controllati dell'ontologia. La proprietà originale ha come domain skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation) e come range skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it relates a concept to a more general concept within the ontology's controlled schemes. The original property has domain skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation) and range skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS, the same property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">broader</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">più ampio</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#SymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS allinea un concetto DeSMòS a un concetto esterno semanticamente vicino ma non equivalente. La proprietà originale ha come domain skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation) e come range skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it aligns a DeSMòS concept with a semantically close but non-equivalent external concept. The original property has domain skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation) and range skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS, the same property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">close match</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">corrispondenza vicina</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#SymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#TransitiveProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS allinea un concetto DeSMòS a un concetto esterno semanticamente equivalente. La proprietà originale ha come domain skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation) e come range skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it aligns a DeSMòS concept with a semantically equivalent external concept. The original property has domain skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation) and range skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS, the same property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">corrispondenza esatta</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">exact match</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS collega uno schema concettuale ai concetti che ne costituiscono i punti di accesso gerarchici principali. La proprietà originale ha come domain skos:ConceptScheme e come range skos:Concept. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain skos:ConceptScheme e come range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it relates a concept scheme to the concepts that are its main hierarchical entry points. The original property has domain skos:ConceptScheme and range skos:Concept. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain skos:ConceptScheme and range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">ha concetto principale</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has top concept</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>

    <!-- http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf -->
    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di skos:hasTopConcept: in DeSMòS collega un concetto allo schema di cui è punto di accesso gerarchico principale. La proprietà originale ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:ConceptScheme. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:ConceptScheme.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of skos:hasTopConcept: in DeSMòS, it relates a concept to the scheme of which it is a main hierarchical entry point. The original property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:ConceptScheme. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:ConceptScheme.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Concetto principale di</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Top concept of</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme">
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS indica lo schema concettuale cui appartiene un concetto. La proprietà originale ha nessun domain dichiarato e come range skos:ConceptScheme. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:ConceptScheme.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it indicates the concept scheme to which a concept belongs. The original property has no declared domain and range skos:ConceptScheme. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:ConceptScheme.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">in scheme</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">nello schema</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di skos:broader: in DeSMòS collega un concetto a un concetto più specifico entro gli schemi controllati dell'ontologia. La proprietà originale ha come domain skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation) e come range skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of skos:broader: in DeSMòS, it relates a concept to a more specific concept within the ontology's controlled schemes. The original property has domain skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation) and range skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS, the same property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">narrower</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">più specifico</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#SymmetricProperty"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS esprime associazioni semantiche non gerarchiche tra concetti dei vocabolari controllati. La proprietà originale ha come domain skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation) e come range skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it expresses non-hierarchical associations between concepts of the controlled vocabularies. The original property has domain skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation) and range skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS, the same property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">correlato</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">related</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS attribuisce una dichiarazione (oggetto linguistico) relativa a una costrizione all'agente che ne è responsabile. La proprietà originale ha come domain prov:Entity e come range prov:Agent. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object e come range crm:E39_Actor (anche prov:Agent).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it attributes a declaration (linguistic object) about a constraint to the agent responsible for it. The original property has domain prov:Entity and range prov:Agent. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object and range crm:E39_Actor (also prov:Agent).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">was attributed to</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">è stato attribuito a</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/constrainsFormalUnit -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/constrainsFormalUnit">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraint"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Collega una costrizione formale all'unità del sistema di scrittura su cui opera (es. lettera, sillaba, parola). La proprietà ha come domain desmos:FormalConstraint e come range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a formal constraint to the unit of the writing system on which it operates (e.g., letter, syllable, word). The property has domain desmos:FormalConstraint and range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">constrains formal unit</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">vincola unità formale</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/isFormalUnitConstrainedBy -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/isFormalUnitConstrainedBy">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/constrainsFormalUnit"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraint"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di constrainsFormalUnit: collega un'unità del sistema di scrittura alle costrizioni formali che operano su di essa. La proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range desmos:FormalConstraint.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of constrainsFormalUnit: relates a unit of the writing system to the formal constraints operating on it. The property has domain skos:Concept and range desmos:FormalConstraint.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is formal unit constrained by</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">è unità formale vincolata da</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/constrainsSemanticUnit -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/constrainsSemanticUnit">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraint"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Collega una costrizione semantica all'unità del piano del contenuto che essa determina (es. personaggio, spazio, tempo). La proprietà ha come domain desmos:SemanticConstraint e come range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a semantic constraint to the unit of the content plane it determines (e.g., character, space, time). The property has domain desmos:SemanticConstraint and range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">constrains semantic unit</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">vincola unità semantica</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/isSemanticUnitConstrainedBy -->
    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/isSemanticUnitConstrainedBy">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/constrainsSemanticUnit"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraint"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di constrainsSemanticUnit: collega un'unità del piano del contenuto alle costrizioni semantiche che la determinano. La proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range desmos:SemanticConstraint.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of constrainsSemanticUnit: relates a unit of the content plane to the semantic constraints that determine it. The property has domain skos:Concept and range desmos:SemanticConstraint.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is semantic unit constrained by</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">è unità semantica vincolata da</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/constraintOrigin -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/constraintOrigin">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/isOriginOf"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Collega una costrizione letteraria al concetto che ne qualifica l'origine (tradizione o invenzione ex novo). La proprietà ha come domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint e come range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a literary constraint to the concept qualifying its origin (tradition or brand-new invention). The property has domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint and range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">constraint origin</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">origine della costrizione</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/hasFeature -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/hasFeature">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Collega un'espressione testuale all'evidenza testuale osservabile di una costrizione. La proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range desmos:TextualFeature.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a textual expression to an observable textual feature of a constraint. The property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range desmos:TextualFeature.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Ha caratteristica</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Has feature</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/isFeatureOf -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/isFeatureOf">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/hasFeature"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di hasFeature: collega un'evidenza testuale della costrizione all'espressione in cui è manifesta. La proprietà ha come domain desmos:TextualFeature e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of hasFeature: relates a textual feature of a constraint to the expression in which it is manifest. The property has domain desmos:TextualFeature and range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">è caratteristica di</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is feature of</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/involvesOperation -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/involvesOperation">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/isOperationInvolvedIn"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Collega una costrizione letteraria all'operazione procedurale che il suo impiego comporta. La proprietà ha come domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint e come range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a literary constraint to the procedural operation its use involves. The property has domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint and range skos:Concept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">coinvolge operazione</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">involves operation</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/isConstraintUsedIn -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/isConstraintUsedIn">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by"/>
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/usedConstraint"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di usedConstraint: collega una costrizione letteraria agli eventi di creazione dell'espressione in cui è stata impiegata come dispositivo generativo; sottoproprietà di crm:P33i_was_used_by. La proprietà ha come domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint e come range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of usedConstraint: relates a literary constraint to the expression creation events in which it was employed as a generative device; subproperty of crm:P33i_was_used_by. The property has domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint and range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is constraint used in</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">è costrizione usata in</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/isOperationInvolvedIn -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/isOperationInvolvedIn">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di involvesOperation: collega un'operazione procedurale alle costrizioni letterarie che la comportano. La proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range desmos:LiteraryConstraint.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of involvesOperation: relates a procedural operation to the literary constraints that involve it. The property has domain skos:Concept and range desmos:LiteraryConstraint.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is operation involved in</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">è l'operazione coinvolta in</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/isOriginOf -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/isOriginOf">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di constraintOrigin: collega un concetto di origine (tradizione o invenzione ex novo) alle costrizioni letterarie che qualifica. La proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range desmos:LiteraryConstraint.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of constraintOrigin: relates an origin concept (tradition or brand-new invention) to the literary constraints it qualifies. The property has domain skos:Concept and range desmos:LiteraryConstraint.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is origin of</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">è origine di</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/isRevealedBy -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/isRevealedBy">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/revealsConstraint"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Collega una costrizione letteraria all'evidenza testuale che ne permette l'identificazione. La proprietà ha come domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint e come range desmos:TextualFeature.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates a literary constraint to the textual feature that makes it identifiable. The property has domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint and range desmos:TextualFeature.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">is revealed by</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">è rivelata da</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/revealsConstraint -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/revealsConstraint">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di isRevealedBy: collega un'evidenza testuale alla costrizione letteraria che rende identificabile. La proprietà ha come domain desmos:TextualFeature e come range desmos:LiteraryConstraint.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of isRevealedBy: relates a textual feature to the literary constraint it makes identifiable. The property has domain desmos:TextualFeature and range desmos:LiteraryConstraint.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">reveals constraint</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">rivela costrizione</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/usedConstraint -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/usedConstraint">
        <rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Collega un evento di creazione dell'espressione alla costrizione letteraria impiegata come dispositivo generativo; sottoproprietà di crm:P33_used_specific_technique. La proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation e come range desmos:LiteraryConstraint.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Relates an expression creation event to the literary constraint employed as a generative device; subproperty of crm:P33_used_specific_technique. The property has domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation and range desmos:LiteraryConstraint.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Usa costrizione</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Uses constraint</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12_hasReferredToEntity -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12_hasReferredToEntity">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12i_isReferredToEntity"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation"/>
        <rdfs:range>
            <owl:Class>
                <owl:unionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F1_Work"/>
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object"/>
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage"/>
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT2_ActualizationOfFeature"/>
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT6_Architext"/>
                </owl:unionOf>
            </owl:Class>
        </rdfs:range>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS identifica l'entità ipotestuale di una relazione intertestuale: l'intera espressione o, se la relazione è localizzabile, un passaggio specifico dell'ipotesto. La proprietà originale ha come domain intro:INT3_Interrelation e come range l'unione di lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature e intro:INT6_Architext. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression o intro:INT21_TextPassage.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it identifies the hypotextual entity of an intertextual relation: the whole expression or, when the relation can be localised, a specific passage of the hypotext. The original property has domain intro:INT3_Interrelation and range the union of lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature and intro:INT6_Architext. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression or intro:INT21_TextPassage.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R12 ha entità a cui si riferisce</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R12 has referred to entity</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12i_isReferredToEntity -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12i_isReferredToEntity">
        <rdfs:domain>
            <owl:Class>
                <owl:unionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F1_Work"/>
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object"/>
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage"/>
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT2_ActualizationOfFeature"/>
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT6_Architext"/>
                </owl:unionOf>
            </owl:Class>
        </rdfs:domain>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di R12 has referred to entity: in DeSMòS collega un'entità ipotestuale (espressione o passaggio) alla relazione intertestuale in cui è l'entità a cui si fa riferimento. La proprietà originale ha come domain l'unione di lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature e intro:INT6_Architext e come range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression o intro:INT21_TextPassage e come range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of R12 has referred to entity: in DeSMòS, it relates a hypotextual entity (expression or passage) to the intertextual relation in which it is the entity referred to. The original property has domain the union of lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature and intro:INT6_Architext and range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression or intro:INT21_TextPassage and range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R12i is referred to entity of</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R12i è entità a cui si riferisce di</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R13_hasReferringEntity -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R13_hasReferringEntity">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R13i_isReferringEntity"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation"/>
        <rdfs:range>
            <owl:Class>
                <owl:unionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F1_Work"/>
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object"/>
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage"/>
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT2_ActualizationOfFeature"/>
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT6_Architext"/>
                </owl:unionOf>
            </owl:Class>
        </rdfs:range>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS identifica l'entità ipertestuale di una relazione intertestuale: l'intera espressione o, se la relazione è localizzabile, un passaggio specifico dell'ipertesto. La proprietà originale ha come domain intro:INT3_Interrelation e come range l'unione di lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature e intro:INT6_Architext. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression o intro:INT21_TextPassage.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it identifies the hypertextual entity of an intertextual relation: the whole expression or, when the relation can be localised, a specific passage of the hypertext. The original property has domain intro:INT3_Interrelation and range the union of lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature and intro:INT6_Architext. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression or intro:INT21_TextPassage.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R13 ha entità referente</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R13 has referring entity</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R13i_isReferringEntity -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R13i_isReferringEntity">
        <rdfs:domain>
            <owl:Class>
                <owl:unionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F1_Work"/>
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object"/>
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage"/>
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT2_ActualizationOfFeature"/>
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT6_Architext"/>
                </owl:unionOf>
            </owl:Class>
        </rdfs:domain>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di R13 has referring entity: in DeSMòS collega un'entità ipertestuale (espressione o passaggio) alla relazione intertestuale in cui è l'entità referente. La proprietà originale ha come domain l'unione di lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature e intro:INT6_Architext e come range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression o intro:INT21_TextPassage e come range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of R13 has referring entity: in DeSMòS, it relates a hypertextual entity (expression or passage) to the intertextual relation in which it is the referring entity. The original property has domain the union of lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature and intro:INT6_Architext and range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression or intro:INT21_TextPassage and range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R13i is referring entity of</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R13i è entità referente di</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R19_hasType -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R19_hasType">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R19i_isTypeOf"/>
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT11_TypeOfInterrelation"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS qualifica una relazione intertestuale con un tipo controllato (es. ipertestualità). La proprietà originale ha come domain intro:INT3_Interrelation e come range intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation e come range intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it qualifies an intertextual relation with a controlled type (e.g., hypertextuality). The original property has domain intro:INT3_Interrelation and range intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation and range intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R19 ha tipo</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R19 has type</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R19i_isTypeOf -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R19i_isTypeOf">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT11_TypeOfInterrelation"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di R19 has type: in DeSMòS collega un tipo di relazione alle relazioni intertestuali che qualifica. La proprietà originale ha come domain intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation e come range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation e come range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of R19 has type: in DeSMòS, it relates a relation type to the intertextual relations it qualifies. The original property has domain intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation and range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation and range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R19i is type of</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R19i è tipo di</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R30_hasTextPassage -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R30_hasTextPassage">
        <owl:inverseOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R30i_isTextPassageOf"/>
        <rdfs:domain>
            <owl:Class>
                <owl:unionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object"/>
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage"/>
                </owl:unionOf>
            </owl:Class>
        </rdfs:domain>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT21_TextPassage"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS collega un'espressione a un passaggio testuale selezionato al suo interno, quando la relazione intertestuale riguarda porzioni specifiche del testo. La proprietà originale ha come domain l'unione di crm:E73_Information_Object e intro:INT1_Passage e come range intro:INT21_TextPassage. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range intro:INT21_TextPassage.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, it relates an expression to a textual passage selected within it, when an intertextual relation concerns specific portions of the text. The original property has domain the union of crm:E73_Information_Object and intro:INT1_Passage and range intro:INT21_TextPassage. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range intro:INT21_TextPassage.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R30 ha passaggio testuale</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R30 has text passage</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R30i_isTextPassageOf -->

    <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R30i_isTextPassageOf">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT21_TextPassage"/>
        <rdfs:range>
            <owl:Class>
                <owl:unionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object"/>
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage"/>
                </owl:unionOf>
            </owl:Class>
        </rdfs:range>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Inversa di R30 has text passage: in DeSMòS collega un passaggio testuale all'espressione da cui è tratto. La proprietà originale ha come domain intro:INT21_TextPassage e come range l'unione di crm:E73_Information_Object e intro:INT1_Passage. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain intro:INT21_TextPassage e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse of R30 has text passage: in DeSMòS, it relates a textual passage to the expression from which it is taken. The original property has domain intro:INT21_TextPassage and range the union of crm:E73_Information_Object and intro:INT1_Passage. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain intro:INT21_TextPassage and range lrmoo:F2_Expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R30i is text passage of</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R30i è passaggio testuale di</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"/>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


    <!-- 
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
    //
    // Data properties
    //
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
     -->

    


    <!-- http://purl.org/dc/terms/created -->

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/created">
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Literal"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, dcterms:created è utilizzata per registrare la data associata all'evento di creazione di un'espressione.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, dcterms:created is used to record the date associated with an expression creation event.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">created</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">creato</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://purl.org/dc/terms/"/>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


    <!-- http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued -->

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued">
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Literal"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, dcterms:issued è utilizzata per registrare la data di pubblicazione o emissione di una manifestazione.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, dcterms:issued is used to record the publication or issuance date of a manifestation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">data di emissione</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">date issued</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://purl.org/dc/terms/"/>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    
    <!-- http://schema.org/pagination -->

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://schema.org/pagination">
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, schema:pagination è utilizzata per registrare la pagina o l'intervallo di pagine di una F3_Manifestation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, schema:pagination is used to record the page or page range of a F3_Manifestation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">pagination</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">paginazione</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://schema.org/"/>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    
    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P3_has_note -->

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P3_has_note">
        <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity"/>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Literal"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, P3 has note è utilizzata per associare a un oggetto linguistico o a una caratteristica testuale una descrizione testuale aggiuntiva espressa come letterale.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, P3 has note is used to associate a linguistic object or textual feature with an additional textual description expressed as a literal.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">ha nota</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has note</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R44_hasWording -->

    <owl:DatatypeProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R44_hasWording">
        <rdfs:domain>
            <owl:Class>
                <owl:unionOf rdf:parseType="Collection">
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT16_Segment"/>
                    <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage"/>
                </owl:unionOf>
            </owl:Class>
        </rdfs:domain>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, R44 has wording è utilizzata per registrare come stringa la formulazione testuale esatta di un passaggio identificato mediante INT21 Text Passage.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, R44 has wording is used to record as a string the exact textual wording of a passage identified through INT21 Text Passage.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">R44 ha formulazione</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">R44 has wording</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"/>
    </owl:DatatypeProperty>
    


    <!-- 
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
    //
    // Classes
    //
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
     -->

    


    <!-- http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F1_Work -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F1_Work">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, F1 Work è utilizzata per rappresentare l'opera come entità astratta, distinta dalle espressioni testuali attraverso cui essa viene realizzata. La proprietà che può essere usata con questa classe è lrmoo:R3_is_realised_in.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, F1 Work is used to represent the work as an abstract entity, distinct from the textual expressions through which it is realised. The property that can be used with this class is lrmoo:R3_is_realised_in.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">F1 Work</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">F1 Opera</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"/>
    </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, F28 Expression Creation è utilizzata per rappresentare l'evento compositivo che produce un'espressione testuale e nel quale può essere impiegata una costrizione letteraria. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono crm:P14_carried_out_by, dcterms:created, desmos:usedConstraint e lrmoo:R17_created.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, F28 Expression Creation is used to represent the compositional event that produces a textual expression and in which a literary constraint may be employed. The properties that can be used with this class are crm:P14_carried_out_by, dcterms:created, desmos:usedConstraint and lrmoo:R17_created.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">F28 Expression Creation</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">F28 Creazione dell'espressione</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"/>
    </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, F2 Expression è utilizzata per rappresentare la realizzazione testuale di un'opera, sulla quale vengono documentate le costrizioni letterarie e le relazioni con altri testi. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono crm:P130_shows_features_of, crm:P148_has_component, crm:P2_has_type, lrmoo:R15_has_fragment, lrmoo:R4i_is_embodied_in e lrmoo:R76_is_derivative_of.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, F2 Expression is used to represent the textual realisation of a work, on which literary constraints and relations to other texts are documented. The properties that can be used with this class are crm:P130_shows_features_of, crm:P148_has_component, crm:P2_has_type, lrmoo:R15_has_fragment, lrmoo:R4i_is_embodied_in and lrmoo:R76_is_derivative_of.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">F2 Expression</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">F2 Espressione</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"/>
    </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F3_Manifestation -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F3_Manifestation">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, F3 Manifestation è utilizzata per rappresentare la manifestazione editoriale o digitale che incorpora un'espressione e alla quale sono associate informazioni relative alla pubblicazione e alla collocazione del testo. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono crm:P148_has_component, crm:P148i_is_component_of, dcterms:issued, lrmoo:R4_embodies e schema:pagination.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, F3 Manifestation is used to represent the published or digital manifestation embodying an expression and carrying information about its publication and textual location. The properties that can be used with this class are crm:P148_has_component, crm:P148i_is_component_of, dcterms:issued, lrmoo:R4_embodies and schema:pagination.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">F3 Manifestation</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">F3 Manifestazione</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"/>
    </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E29_Design_or_Procedure -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E29_Design_or_Procedure">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, E29 Design or Procedure fornisce la categoria procedurale entro cui è modellata desmos:LiteraryConstraint, intesa come procedura applicata durante la creazione di un'espressione.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, E29 Design or Procedure provides the procedural category under which desmos:LiteraryConstraint is modelled, as a procedure applied during the creation of an expression.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">E29 Design or Procedure</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">E29 Progetto o Procedura</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E33_Linguistic_Object">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, E33 Linguistic Object è utilizzata per identificare passaggi paratestuali (epitestuali o peritestuali) nei quali l'autore o il curatore del volume dichiara l'utilizzo di una costrizione letteraria. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono crm:P129_is_about, crm:P3_has_note, crm:P67_refers_to e prov:wasAttributedTo.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, E33 Linguistic Object is used to identify paratextual passages (epitextual or peritextual) in which the author or editor of the volume declares the use of a literary constraint. The properties that can be used with this class are crm:P129_is_about, crm:P3_has_note, crm:P67_refers_to and prov:wasAttributedTo.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">E33 Linguistic Object</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">E33 Oggetto Linguistico</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E39_Actor -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E39_Actor">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, E39 Actor è utilizzata per rappresentare autori, curatori e soggetti collettivi coinvolti nella creazione e nella documentazione delle espressioni testuali.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, E39 Actor is used to represent authors, editors, and collective agents involved in the creation and documentation of textual expressions.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">E39 Actor</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">E39 Attore</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E55_Type -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E55_Type">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, E55 Type è utilizzata per due ordini di tipi controllati: le forme espressive delle opere (prosa, poesia, poesia visiva, arte visiva, musica), assegnate alle espressioni mediante P2 has type, e, attraverso la sottoclasse INTRO INT11 Type of Interrelation, i tipi di relazione intertestuale come l'ipertestualità, assegnati mediante R19 has type. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono skos:exactMatch e skos:inScheme.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, E55 Type is used for two kinds of controlled types: the expressive forms of works (prose, poetry, visual poetry, visual art, music), assigned to expressions via P2 has type, and, through the INTRO subclass INT11 Type of Interrelation, intertextual relation types such as hypertextuality, assigned via R19 has type. The properties that can be used with this class are skos:exactMatch and skos:inScheme.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">E55 Type</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">E55 Tipo</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E90_Symbolic_Object"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, E73 Information Object è utilizzata come categoria generale per gli oggetti informativi coinvolti nella rappresentazione del testo e delle procedure ad esso associate, attraverso le classi specializzate riprese da CIDOC CRM, LRMoo e INTRO.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, E73 Information Object is used as a general category for information objects involved in the representation of texts and their associated procedures, through specialised classes reused from CIDOC CRM, LRMoo, and INTRO.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">E73 Information Object</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">E73 Oggetto Informativo</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Questa classe comprende entità che esistono come insiemi di caratteristiche o proprietà, piuttosto che come oggetti fisici. In DeSMòS, rappresenta le entità astratte come le opere, le costrizioni letterarie e le relazioni intertestuali.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This class comprises entities that exist as sets of characteristics or properties rather than as physical objects. In DeSMòS, it represents abstract entities such as works, literary constraints, and intertextual relations.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">E89 Propositional Object</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">E89 Oggetto Proposizionale</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:Class>

    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity">
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, E1 CRM Entity is the root of the CIDOC CRM hierarchy and is referenced as the original domain or range of P2 has type, P3 has note, P67 refers to and P129 is about. E7 Activity, E39 Actor and E70 Thing are declared as its direct subclasses, abbreviating the official chains through E5 Event and E77 Persistent Item.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, E1 CRM Entity è la radice della gerarchia di CIDOC CRM ed è referenziata come domain o range originale di P2 has type, P3 has note, P67 refers to e P129 is about. E7 Activity, E39 Actor ed E70 Thing ne sono dichiarate sottoclassi dirette, abbreviando le catene ufficiali che passano per E5 Event ed E77 Persistent Item.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">E1 CRM Entity</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">E1 Entità CRM</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:Class>

    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, E7 Activity is referenced as the original domain of P14 carried out by and P33 used specific technique. lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation is declared as its direct subclass, abbreviating the official chain F28 Expression Creation ⊑ E65 Creation ⊑ E7 Activity (LRMoo 1.0; CIDOC CRM 7.1.3).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, E7 Activity è referenziata come domain originale di P14 carried out by e P33 used specific technique. lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation ne è dichiarata sottoclasse diretta, abbreviando la catena ufficiale F28 Expression Creation ⊑ E65 Creation ⊑ E7 Activity (LRMoo 1.0; CIDOC CRM 7.1.3).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">E7 Activity</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">E7 Attività</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:Class>

    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E70_Thing -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E70_Thing">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, E70 Thing is referenced as the original domain and range of P130 shows features of. E28 Conceptual Object is declared as its direct subclass, abbreviating the official chain E28 Conceptual Object ⊑ E71 Human-Made Thing ⊑ E70 Thing (CIDOC CRM 7.1.3).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, E70 Thing è referenziata come domain e range originali di P130 shows features of. E28 Conceptual Object ne è dichiarata sottoclasse diretta, abbreviando la catena ufficiale E28 Conceptual Object ⊑ E71 Human-Made Thing ⊑ E70 Thing (CIDOC CRM 7.1.3).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">E70 Thing</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">E70 Cosa</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:Class>

    <!-- http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E90_Symbolic_Object -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E90_Symbolic_Object">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, E90 Symbolic Object is referenced as the original range of R15 has fragment: the peritextual statements (E33 Linguistic Object) linked to an expression through R15 are symbolic objects via E73 Information Object. It is the superclass of E73 Information Object and, in INTRO, of INT1 Passage and INT16 Segment.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, E90 Symbolic Object è referenziata come range originale di R15 has fragment: le dichiarazioni peritestuali (E33 Linguistic Object) collegate a un'espressione mediante R15 sono oggetti simbolici attraverso E73 Information Object. È superclasse di E73 Information Object e, in INTRO, di INT1 Passage e INT16 Segment.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">E90 Symbolic Object</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">E90 Oggetto Simbolico</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
    </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept">
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, la classe viene utilizzata per definire le singole costrizioni letterarie e le categorie analitiche all'interno di un sistema di conoscenza organizzato. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono desmos:coarserThan, desmos:constrainsFormalUnit, desmos:constrainsSemanticUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:finerThan, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:broader, skos:closeMatch, skos:exactMatch, skos:inScheme, skos:narrower e skos:related.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, the class is used to define individual literary constraints and analytical categories within an organized knowledge system. The properties that can be used with this class are desmos:coarserThan, desmos:constrainsFormalUnit, desmos:constrainsSemanticUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:finerThan, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:broader, skos:closeMatch, skos:exactMatch, skos:inScheme, skos:narrower and skos:related.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Concept</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Concetto</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"/>
    </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme">
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, skos:ConceptScheme is used to organise literary constraints and the analytical categories used to describe them into controlled vocabularies. The property that can be used with this class is skos:hasTopConcept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, skos:ConceptScheme è utilizzata per organizzare in vocabolari controllati le costrizioni letterarie e le categorie analitiche impiegate per descriverle. La proprietà che può essere usata con questa classe è skos:hasTopConcept.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Concept Scheme</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Schema di concetti</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"/>
    </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent">
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, prov:Agent is used to represent agents to whom entities or declarations are attributed, including authors, editors, collective agents and, where relevant, software systems.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, prov:Agent è utilizzata per rappresentare gli agenti ai quali vengono attribuite entità o dichiarazioni, inclusi autori, curatori, soggetti collettivi e, ove pertinente, sistemi software.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Agent</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Agente</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#"/>
    </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity">
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, prov:Entity è utilizzata come categoria di provenienza per gli oggetti linguistici di cui viene documentata l'attribuzione a un agente, in particolare le dichiarazioni relative alle costrizioni letterarie.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, prov:Entity is used as a provenance category for linguistic objects whose attribution to an agent is documented, particularly declarations concerning literary constraints.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Entity</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Entità</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#"/>
    </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraint -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraint">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint"/>
        <owl:disjointWith rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraint"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Constraint that intervenes primarily on the signifier. The properties that can be used with this class are desmos:constrainsFormalUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:broader, skos:closeMatch, skos:inScheme, skos:narrower and skos:related.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Costrizione che interviene prioritariamente sul significante. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono desmos:constrainsFormalUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:broader, skos:closeMatch, skos:inScheme, skos:narrower e skos:related.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Costrizione formale</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Formal constraint</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:Class>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/VisualConstraint -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/VisualConstraint">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraint"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Visual Constraint intervening on the visual or typographic arrangement of the text, where the spatial layout of letters/words on the page is itself part of the rule. The properties that can be used with this class are desmos:constrainsFormalUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:closeMatch, skos:inScheme and skos:related.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Costrizione visiva che interviene sulla disposizione visiva o tipografica del testo, in cui l'impaginazione spaziale di lettere/parole sulla pagina è essa stessa parte della regola. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono desmos:constrainsFormalUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:closeMatch, skos:inScheme e skos:related.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Costrizione visiva</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Visual constraint</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E29_Design_or_Procedure"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"/> 
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A formal or semantic procedure intervening in the process of textual generation (F28 Expression Creation). Its presence may be documented through objective evidence (TextualFeature) or paratextual statements (E33 Linguistic Object).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Procedura formale o semantica che interviene nel processo di generazione testuale (F28 Expression Creation). La sua presenza può essere documentata attraverso evidenze oggettive (TextualFeature) o dichiarazioni paratestuali (E33 Linguistic Object).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Costrizione letteraria</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Literary constraint</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraint -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraint">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint"/>
        <owl:disjointWith rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraint"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Constraint that intervenes primarily on the signified. The properties that can be used with this class are desmos:constrainsSemanticUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:inScheme and skos:related.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Costrizione che interviene prioritariamente sul significato. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono desmos:constrainsSemanticUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:inScheme e skos:related.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Costrizione semantica</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Semantic constraint</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Caratteristica osservabile dell’espressione che può rendere leggibile una costrizione. In DeSMòS è intesa come evidenza intratestuale: una traccia testuale che supporta l’identificazione della costrizione, senza implicare di per sé sufficienza o necessità. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono crm:P3_has_note, desmos:isFeatureOf e desmos:revealsConstraint.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Observable feature of an expression that may make a constraint legible. In DeSMòS it is treated as intratextual evidence: a textual trace supporting the identification of a constraint, without implying necessity or sufficiency by itself. The properties that can be used with this class are crm:P3_has_note, desmos:isFeatureOf and desmos:revealsConstraint.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Caratteristica testuale</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Textual feature</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT21_TextPassage -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT21_TextPassage">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, INT21 Text Passage è utilizzata per rappresentare una porzione testuale identificabile di un'espressione, in particolare quando è necessario documentare i passaggi coinvolti in una relazione intertestuale. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono intro:R30i_isTextPassageOf e intro:R44_hasWording.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, INT21 Text Passage is used to represent an identifiable textual portion of an expression, particularly when documenting passages involved in an intertextual relation. The properties that can be used with this class are intro:R30i_isTextPassageOf and intro:R44_hasWording.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">INT21 Text Passage</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">INT21 Passaggio Testuale</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"/>
    </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT31_IntertextualRelation -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT31_IntertextualRelation">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, INT31 Intertextual Relation è utilizzata per rappresentare come entità autonoma una relazione intertestuale tra testi o loro passaggi, specificandone le entità coinvolte e la tipologia. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono intro:R12_hasReferredToEntity, intro:R13_hasReferringEntity e intro:R19_hasType.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, INT31 Intertextual Relation is used to represent an intertextual relation between texts or their passages as an independent entity, specifying the entities involved and the relation type. The properties that can be used with this class are intro:R12_hasReferredToEntity, intro:R13_hasReferringEntity and intro:R19_hasType.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">INT31 Intertextual Relation</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">INT31 Relazione Intertestuale</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"/>
    </owl:Class>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, INT3 Interrelation fornisce la categoria generale per la rappresentazione reificata delle relazioni tra entità, specializzata attraverso INT31 Intertextual Relation per le relazioni intertestuali considerate nel modello.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, INT3 Interrelation provides the general category for the reified representation of relations between entities, specialised through INT31 Intertextual Relation for the intertextual relations considered in the model.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">INT3 Interrelation</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">INT3 Interrelazione</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"/>
    </owl:Class>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT11_TypeOfInterrelation -->
    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT11_TypeOfInterrelation">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E55_Type"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, INT11 Type of Interrelation is used as a general category for the types that qualify intertextual relations represented through INTRO.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, INT11 Type of Interrelation è utilizzata come categoria generale per i tipi che qualificano le relazioni intertestuali rappresentate attraverso INTRO.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">INT11 Type of Interrelation</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">INT11 Tipo di interrelazione</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"/>
    </owl:Class>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT15_IntertextualityInIntertextualityTheories -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT15_IntertextualityInIntertextualityTheories">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT11_TypeOfInterrelation"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, INT15 Intertextuality in Intertextuality Theories is used to represent relation types derived from theories of intertextuality, including hypertextuality in Gérard Genette's classification.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, INT15 Intertextuality in Intertextuality Theories è utilizzata per rappresentare tipi di relazione derivati da teorie dell'intertestualità, tra cui l'ipertestualità nella classificazione di Gérard Genette.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">INT15 Intertextuality in Intertextuality Theories</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">INT15 Intertestualità nelle teorie dell'intertestualità</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"/>
    </owl:Class>

    <!-- https://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object -->
    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E70_Thing"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">E28 Conceptual Object</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">E28 Oggetto Concettuale</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, E28 Conceptual Object provides the conceptual category under which intro:INT3_Interrelation is positioned.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, E28 Conceptual Object fornisce la categoria concettuale entro cui è ricondotta intro:INT3_Interrelation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"/>
        </owl:Class>
    
    <!-- https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage -->
    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E90_Symbolic_Object"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">INT1 Passage</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">INT1 Passaggio</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, INT1 Passage provides the general category for intro:INT21_TextPassage, used to represent textual passages involved in intertextual relations.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, INT1 Passage fornisce la categoria generale per intro:INT21_TextPassage, utilizzata per rappresentare i passaggi testuali coinvolti nelle relazioni intertestuali.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"/>
    </owl:Class>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT2_ActualizationOfFeature -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT2_ActualizationOfFeature">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, INT2 Actualization of Feature is referenced only as a member of the original union range of R12 has referred to entity and R13 has referring entity, and of the union domain of their inverses; it is not instantiated in the DeSMòS corpus.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, INT2 Actualization of Feature è referenziata solo come membro dell'unione che costituisce il range originale di R12 has referred to entity e R13 has referring entity, e il domain delle loro inverse; non è istanziata nel corpus DeSMòS.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">INT2 Actualization of Feature</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">INT2 Attualizzazione di caratteristica</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"/>
    </owl:Class>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT6_Architext -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT6_Architext">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E28_Conceptual_Object"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, INT6 Architext is referenced only as a member of the original union range of R12 has referred to entity and R13 has referring entity, and of the union domain of their inverses; it is not instantiated in the DeSMòS corpus.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, INT6 Architext è referenziata solo come membro dell'unione che costituisce il range originale di R12 has referred to entity e R13 has referring entity, e il domain delle loro inverse; non è istanziata nel corpus DeSMòS.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">INT6 Architext</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">INT6 Architesto</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"/>
    </owl:Class>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT16_Segment -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT16_Segment">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E90_Symbolic_Object"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">In DeSMòS, INT16 Segment is referenced only as a member of the original union domain of R44 has wording; it is not instantiated in the DeSMòS corpus, where R44 is applied to INT21 Text Passage.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">In DeSMòS, INT16 Segment è referenziata solo come membro dell'unione che costituisce il domain originale di R44 has wording; non è istanziata nel corpus DeSMòS, dove R44 è applicata a INT21 Text Passage.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">INT16 Segment</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">INT16 Segmento</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"/>
    </owl:Class>

    


    <!-- 
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
    //
    // Individuals
    //
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
     -->




    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/hypertextuality -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/hypertextuality">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT15_IntertextualityInIntertextualityTheories"/>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Hypertextuality</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="it">Ipertestualità</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Type of intertextual relation, in the Genettian sense, designating any relationship of derivation linking a later text (the hypertext) to an earlier one (the hypotext) upon which it is grafted in a manner that is not that of commentary; the derivation may proceed by transformation (as in parody) or by imitation (as in pastiche).</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="it">Tipo di relazione intertestuale, nell'accezione genettiana, che designa qualsiasi rapporto di derivazione che collega un testo posteriore (l'ipertesto) ad un testo anteriore (l'ipotesto) sul quale esso si innesta in modo non commentativo; la derivazione può realizzarsi per trasformazione (come nella parodia) o per imitazione (come nel pastiche).</skos:definition>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Used as the object of intro:R19_hasType to qualify instances of intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation as Genettian hypertextual relations.</skos:scopeNote>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="it">Utilizzato come oggetto di intro:R19_hasType per qualificare istanze di intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation come relazioni ipertestuali genettiane.</skos:scopeNote>
        <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://www.worldcat.org/isbn/9782020061162"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Hypertextuality</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Ipertestualità</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

    <!-- 
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
    //
    // SKOS ConceptScheme
    // 
    ///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
     -->

    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/ConstraintOriginScheme -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/ConstraintOriginScheme">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Concept scheme distinguishing between traditional constraints and newly introduced constraints in a specific compositional context. Expected as the range value of desmos:constraintOrigin.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Schema concettuale che distingue le costrizioni riprese dalla tradizione da quelle introdotte ex novo in uno specifico contesto compositivo. Atteso come valore del range di desmos:constraintOrigin.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Constraint Origin Scheme</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Schema dell'origine della costrizione</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraintScheme -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraintScheme">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Schema concettuale che raccoglie le costrizioni formali, che intervengono prioritariamente sul significante del testo.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Concept scheme collecting formal constraints, which intervene primarily on the signifier of the text.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Formal Constraint Scheme</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Schema delle costrizioni formali</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/VisualConstraintScheme -->
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/VisualConstraintScheme">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Schema concettuale che raccoglie le costrizioni visive, che intervengono sulla disposizione spaziale, grafica o tipografica del testo sulla pagina.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Concept scheme collecting visual constraints, which intervene on the spatial, graphic or typographic arrangement of the text on the page.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Visual Constraint Scheme</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Schema delle costrizioni visive</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraintScheme -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraintScheme">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Schema concettuale che raccoglie le costrizioni semantiche, che intervengono prioritariamente sul significato del testo.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Concept scheme collecting semantic constraints, which intervene primarily on the signified of the text.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Semantic Constraint Scheme</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Schema delle costrizioni semantiche</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryFormScheme -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryFormScheme">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Concept scheme defining the textual form of the work (prose, poetry, visual form). Used to qualify lrmoo:F2_Expression instances via crm:P2_has_type.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Schema concettuale che definisce la forma testuale dell'opera (prosa, poesia, forma visuale). Utilizzato per qualificare istanze di lrmoo:F2_Expression tramite crm:P2_has_type.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Literary Form Scheme</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Schema delle forme letterarie</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

        <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/ArtisticFormScheme -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/ArtisticFormScheme">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Concept scheme defining the artistic form of non-linguistic expressions (visual art, music). Used to qualify lrmoo:F2_Expression instances via crm:P2_has_type, complementing desmos:LiteraryFormScheme where the source expression is not a text.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Schema concettuale che definisce la forma artistica di espressioni non linguistiche (arte visuale, musica). Utilizzato per qualificare istanze di lrmoo:F2_Expression tramite crm:P2_has_type, in complemento a desmos:LiteraryFormScheme nei casi in cui l'espressione non sia un testo.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Artistic Form Scheme</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Schema delle forme artistiche</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalUnitScheme -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalUnitScheme">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Concept scheme defining the discrete units of the writing system (e.g., letter, syllable, word) on which a formal constraint operates. Expected as the range value of desmos:constrainsFormalUnit.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Schema concettuale che definisce le unità discrete del sistema di scrittura (ad esempio lettera, sillaba, parola) su cui opera una costrizione di tipo formale. Atteso come valore del range di desmos:constrainsFormalUnit.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Formal Unit Scheme</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Schema delle unità formali</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticUnitScheme -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticUnitScheme">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Concept scheme defining the discrete units of the content plane (e.g., character, space, time) determined by a semantic constraint. Expected as the range value of desmos:constrainsSemanticUnit.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Schema concettuale che definisce le unità discrete del piano del contenuto (personaggio, spazio, tempo) determinate da una costrizione di tipo semantico. Atteso come valore del range di desmos:constrainsSemanticUnit.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Semantic Unit Scheme</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Schema delle unità semantiche</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>

    <!-- https://w3id.org/desmos/ProceduralOperationScheme -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://w3id.org/desmos/ProceduralOperationScheme">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Concept scheme describing the procedural operations applied to generate the constrained text. Expected as the range value of desmos:involvesOperation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="it">Schema concettuale che descrive le operazioni procedurali applicate per generare il testo vincolato. Atteso come valore del range di desmos:involvesOperation.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Procedural Operation Scheme</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="it">Schema delle operazioni procedurali</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/desmos/"/>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
</rdf:RDF>



